# "As this land enters, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters tapped" (CR 614.1d): Bot1 declines, so the Tomb
# enters tapped with its life untouched, and cannot be tapped for mana that turn. It is a Swamp Forest (CR 205.3i) with
# both basic land mana abilities: next turn it adds {B}, the other color it can make, the control for the {G} the
# paying scenario takes.

[Bot1 Deck]
Overgrown Tomb
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Overgrown Tomb.Play
Bot1.Decline
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Tomb.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Tomb.Subtypes = Forest; Swamp
! Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Tomb.Activate(Ability: {B})
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Tomb.Activate(Ability: {B})
? Bot1.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Tomb.Tapped = true
